    <item>
      <title>PortWin 1.24</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 14:29:33 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Disc images: open or drag an .iso — PortWin shows it to Windows as a CD drive and runs the installer from it. The disc stays in the bottle, so games that ask for the CD find it at every launch, even after a restart. Second disc during installation: just drag its image in.</li><li>Installed programs no longer look crashed right after launch: shortcuts now start the program itself.</li><li>Installers that finish in a second window (WinRAR, InstallShield) are waited for, so the program appears in the list by itself.</li><li>No more License/Changelog text files or duplicate entries in the program list after installing.</li><li>Epic Games, GOG Galaxy and Battle.net recipes use the built-in graphics; the Epic launcher no longer crashes at start.</li></ul>]]></description>
